    EPJ Web of Conferences 284, 17006 (2023)                         2 1451
[2] J.R. Granada and V.H. Gillette, Physica B 348, 6 (2004)          2 1451
[3] Young, J.A. and Koppel, J.U. Phys. Rev. A 135, 603 (1964)        2 1451
[4] Thermal Scattering Law S(a,b): Measurement, Evaluation and       2 1451
    Application,International Evaluation Cooperation Volume 42,      2 1451
    Nuclear Energy Agency, report number NEA No. 7511, 2020          2 1451
